    <section class="section" id="exercises">
      <span class="section-label">Practice</span>
      <h2>Exercises</h2>

      <h3>Exercise 1: Metric Computation</h3>
      <p>Given predicted and actual values for a regression model, compute MAE, MSE, RMSE, MAPE, and R² by hand. Then verify with scikit-learn.</p>

      <h3>Exercise 2: Metric Comparison</h3>
      <p>Train three different regression models. Compare their performance using different metrics. Which metric would you use to declare a "winner"? Why?</p>

      <h3>Exercise 3: Outlier Impact</h3>
      <p>Train a regression model with and without outliers. Compare MAE and RMSE. Show how RMSE is more sensitive to outliers due to squaring.</p>

